  "details": "love to see there is more information about the layer system in VRChat !\n\nbut it seems it's still missing the big part that i requested personnally a few years ago...\n\ni would like to have specifics on what layers are rendered for each camera that VRChat instances:\n\nViewport (Player View) : what layers is rendered and which is hidden\n\nPhoto/Stream Camera (Third person view) : What layers are rendered, which are hidden\n\ni would like to make some assets render specifically inside the stream camera, but not the viewport render...\n\nI could do trial and error but it seems to be time wasted\n\nif  i could find this information in the creator docs and save hours\n\n(PS: i would also like to see the internal collision matrix vrchat uses inside the docs, but i don't feel like opening another Canny for a very similar request...)",
